     "forbidden": {
      "name": "Catrin del Ultimo Coro",
      "text": "_Forbidden Form — Defiled Servant_\n\n> _Every soul is a song, and he has heard how each one ends. Tonight, he plays yours — and for those who stand beside him, he plays it beautifully._\n\n![](img/forbidden_catrin.png)\n\nThe gold burns away to a charro suit of deepest black, silver bone-embroidery gleaming down the sleeves, sombrero shading two hollow sockets. The trumpet folds and stretches into a scythe held like the bow of a guitarrón — and behind him, an unseen band tunes instruments strung with the last measures of every life on the field.\n\n_Large Aberration, Unaligned_\n\n---\n\n> [!danger] This is a **complete replacement**. It is not Catrin.\n> It has **no spell slots** — no *animate objects*, no *polymorph*, no *mass cure wounds* — no Bardic Inspiration of the kind he hands out freely, no Combat Inspiration, no Countercharm. **It does not know \"para que nadie luche solo.\"** It knows that every song has a last bar, and it knows yours.\n> Universal Defiled rules from the Parted Gates are folded into the numbers below — **Aberrant Precision**, **Too Many Limbs** and **Warped Flesh**.\n\n**Armor Class** 17 *(13 + PB, the silence between beats)*\n**Hit Points** — *(Soul Tether: shares the pooled total, his 80 plus the Grimm User's)*\n**Speed** 30 ft., fly 50 ft. *(hover)*\n**Challenge** 18 *(CR 15 + 3, for Arcane Repose)*\n\n---\n\n**STR** 14 (+2) | **DEX** 18 (+4) | **CON** 16 (+3) | **INT** 16 (+3) | **WIS** 16 (+3) | **CHA** 24 (+7)\n\n---\n\n**Saving Throws** Cha +11, Wis +7, Dex +8 *(ability modifier + PB)*\n**Skills** Performance +11, Insight +7\n**Damage Reduction** **a quarter of all damage** *(Warped Flesh + Soul Tether)*; radiant and all-mighty are only halved\n**Damage Vulnerabilities** bludgeoning *(the frame is still bone — and it still breaks)*\n**Condition Immunities** charmed, frightened, exhaustion\n**Senses** darkvision 120 ft., passive Perception 17\n**Languages** all he knew in life, telepathy 60 ft.\n**Save DC** 22 *(8 + PB + Cha + Aberrant Precision)*\n\n---\n\n### Traits\n\n**Requiem Voice.** For each point of the Grimm User's PB above 4, its Charisma and Wisdom scores increase by 2 (adjusting its attacks, saves, checks, and Save DC accordingly — see Scaling Reference).\n\n**La Última Nota.** It hears the final measure of every living thing. When it deals damage to a creature that has **10 × PB** or fewer hit points remaining, that creature must make a Constitution Saving Throw against its Save DC or its song ends — it drops to **0 hit points**.\n\n**⭐ La Coda.** *(Unnatural Phenomenon.)* No encores. Within **30 ft.**, **no creature other than the Grimm User can regain hit points by any means** — not a spell, not a potion, not a feature, not Zenith, not Alaric's Lay on Hands. It is not a reduction and not a halving: **the healing does not happen.** The resource is spent and nothing comes of it.\n> *Open the dark arc on Catrin and you have switched off your own healers inside a 30-ft. bubble that follows him. That is the trade.*\n\n**Serenata Fúnebre.** When an enemy within 60 ft. drops to 0 hit points, it plays a single, gorgeous farewell bar — each ally within 30 ft. gains one of its inspiration dice *(d10)*. *(Sing, muchachos. The night is short.)*\n\n### Actions\n\n**Multiattack.** It makes **three** attacks, in any combination of Guadaña del Compás and Compás Robado.\n\n**Guadaña del Compás.** _Melee Weapon Attack:_ **+14** to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. _Hit:_ **2d12 + 7** psychic damage — the sound of the target's own final measure, played early.\n\n**Compás Robado.** It plucks a bar of music from a creature's remaining song. One creature within 60 ft. makes a Wisdom Saving Throw, taking **PB d8** psychic damage on a failure, or half on a success. The **shared hit point pool** regains hit points equal to half the damage dealt. *This is theft, not healing, so **La Coda does not stop it.***\n\n**Las Golondrinas (1/summon).** The unseen band strikes up the farewell song, and every enemy hears their own ending in it. Each enemy within 30 ft. makes a Wisdom Saving Throw, taking **PB × 3 d10** damage on a failure, or half on a success. This damage is **all-mighty** and ignores all resistances and immunities. A creature that fails cannot regain hit points until the end of its next turn. *A creature that cannot hear it has advantage on the save.*\n\n### Bonus Actions\n\n**Cuenta el Compás.** It taps out the beat. Until the start of its next turn, the radius of **La Coda** becomes **60 ft.** *(Its extra Bonus Action from **Too Many Limbs**.)*\n\n### Reactions\n\n**Encore Negado.** When a creature within 60 ft. is reduced to 0 hit points, it seizes the final note as it fades — the **shared hit point pool** regains **5 × PB** hit points, and its next attack before the end of its next turn deals an extra **PB d8** psychic damage.\n\n---\n\n### Instinct — when it does not come back\n\n| d4 | What it does on its turn |\n|:--:|---|\n| 1 | **It goes to whoever is nearest death** and finishes the song — *La Última Nota* on the lowest-hit-point creature in reach, ally or enemy. |\n| 2 | **It plays for the loudest.** It attacks whichever creature dealt the most damage last round. The band appreciates an energetic audience. |\n| 3 | **It drifts to the centre of the field** and stays there, so that *La Coda* covers as many creatures as possible. It attacks whatever is adjacent. Nobody is getting healed tonight. |\n| 4 | **It stops.** It takes no action and simply plays — every creature within 60 ft. other than the Grimm User makes a Wisdom save against *Compás Robado*, and the song takes a bar from all of them. |\n\n> [!note] DM — the horror here is logistical, and that is the good kind\n> An uncontrolled Último Coro does not need to out-damage anyone. **It stands in the middle of the room and healing stops existing**, and then it walks toward whoever is dying. The party's answer is to *move the fight away from it* or to drop it with bludgeoning, which it is still vulnerable to — that vulnerability is deliberately left in as the handle.\n\n---\n\n## Scaling Reference\n\n| PB  | CHA / WIS | To hit | Save DC | AC  | Notes                                            |\n| :-: | :-------: | :----: | :-----: | :-: | :----------------------------------------------- |\n|  4  |  24 / 16  |  +14   |   22    | 17  | 3 attacks, Última Nota ≤40 HP, Golondrinas 12d10, Robo 4d8 |\n|  5  |  26 / 18  |  +16   |   24    | 18  | 3 attacks, Última Nota ≤50 HP, Golondrinas 15d10, Robo 5d8 |\n|  6  |  28 / 20  |  +18   |   26    | 19  | **4 attacks**, Última Nota ≤60 HP, Golondrinas 18d10, Robo 6d8 |"
     }
