        "text": "Seven coronas ring the black sun, each tied to a damage type: acid, cold, fire, force, lightning, necrotic, and radiant. The first time **you** deal a given type to a hostile in the domain — any amount — that corona **ignites** and stays lit. (Allies' damage does not light coronas; these are yours to conduct.) While all seven burn at once, you may unleash **Stellar Apotheosis**; doing so darkens all seven, and they begin igniting anew."
