     "action": "Action",
     "text": "In this form Víðarr can function as a familiar. As an **Action** your Grimm turns into a familiar as per the Find Familiar Spell with some alterations.\n* You cannot choose between celestial, fey or fiend instead is considered a Grimm.\n* The Grimm does not have hp, the moment it takes any kind of damage it returns to the Grimm User and it takes the damage instead.\n* It's stats can be found on Apendix A."
