    "intro": "> *The verdict was never in doubt. Only the sentence remained to be forged.*\n\n![](img/realityShift_Purgatory.png)\n\n**Description.** The Node falls as a courtroom of ash — every trapped creature an accused, the ground a ledger of debts, and Fenrir the sentence Zariel carries out.",
