      "title": "Appendix: Fenrir's Toll",
      "text": "*Per-hit damage, set once at activation from the summed CR of all trapped enemies. Dice become d12 if any trapped enemy has Legendary Actions or Resistances.*\n\n| Total Enemy CR Sum |       Fenrir Damage (per hit)       |\n| :----------------: | :---------------------------------: |\n|        1–5         |                2d10                 |\n|        6–10        |                3d10                 |\n|       11–15        |                4d10                 |\n|       16–20        |                5d10                 |\n|       21–25        |                6d10                 |\n|       26–30        |                7d10                 |\n|        31+         | 8d10, +1d10 per full 5 CR beyond 30 |"
