        "text": "The Warren pulses with vorpal energy — choose one. *(Wins ties on the count.)*\n- **Trap Coordination Protocol.** **Move up to 3 traps** to new places within 120 ft, and **set 1 more** from the Library if you are below your maximum.\n- **Vorpal Ambush Strike.** Any number of your troops within 60 ft each **use one of their job's Actions immediately**, even if they have already acted this round, **with advantage**, scoring critical hits on **18–20**. If **Vorpal Energy** or **Underblade** is up, those attacks carry the vorpal damage too.\n- **Reinforcement Surge.** **Summon a Reinforcement Troop** of any specialization, over your normal limits, within 30 ft of you or another troop. It arrives fully corporeal at full HP with all its abilities and **acts immediately** on this count. It lasts until the end of your next turn, or until the Shift ends."
