     {
      "title": "Appendix: Umbra Platoon Statblocks",
      "text": "Inside the Warren every troop keeps its job abilities from the base Grimm and gains a corporeal form.\n\n> [!info] Each job now has its own statblock note\n> The full entries live in `Player Grimms/White Rabbit/Troops/` — Infantry, Scout, Medic, Magus, Bulwark, and the shared Universal Traits. **Those notes own the numbers**, and the Grimm Companion reads them straight from there (art, HP, AC, Speed, charges). What follows is the summary at the table; if the two ever disagree, the job's own note is right.\n\n### Universal traits\n- **Type:** Grimm · **Resistances:** psychic, force · **Immunities:** poison\n- **Condition immunities:** charmed, frightened, poisoned\n- **Senses:** darkvision 60 ft; sees invisible creatures within 30 ft\n- **Languages:** understands every language you speak; telepathic link with you\n- Troops use **your Proficiency Bonus** for all rolls\n- **Warren Sense.** Detects your traps within 30 ft and knows their type.\n- **Silk Step.** Its movement provokes no opportunity attacks if it ends its turn within 10 ft of another troop.\n- **Coordinated Strike.** +2 to attack when attacking the same target as another troop.\n- **Last Stand.** At 0 HP it stays standing and can still act until the end of your next turn, then dies if not healed. **Any healing saves it — including *Spare the Dying*.** A troop that does die is re-formed whole by a Short Rest; a Vorpal Bunny is shadow and memory, and only has to be called again.\n\n### Infantry — front-line striker\n*Base job:* critical range +1 per Infantry · Vorpal Slash · War Cry (2 charges).\n**HP** 50 + (5 × your level) · **AC** 20 · **Speed** 40 ft, climb 20 ft\n**Special.** After a critical hit, advantage on its next attack this turn.\n\n### Scout — ranged reconnaissance\n*Base job:* +1 to your attacks and damage, +3 Perception per Scout · Psionic Arrow · Disrupting Bolt (1 charge).\n**HP** 40 + (4 × your level) · **AC** 22 · **Speed** 50 ft, climb 30 ft\n**Special.** Advantage on initiative; may Help as a Bonus Action without being adjacent.\n\n### Medic — support healer\n*Base job:* +10 max HP to you per Medic · Fluffy Paw (3 charges) · Spare the Dying · Purge Pain (1 charge).\n**HP** 55 + (5 × your level) · **AC** 18 · **Speed** 35 ft\n**Special.** An ally it heals also gains temporary HP equal to your Wisdom modifier.\n\n### Magus — arcane artillery\n*Base job:* +1 to your spell attacks and save DC per Magus · Magic Edge (3 charges) · Thorn Whip · Arcane Nova (2 charges).\n**HP** 45 + (4 × your level) · **AC** 15 · **Speed** 30 ft\n**Special.** May cast one cantrip as a Bonus Action once per turn.\n\n### Bulwark — defensive guardian\n*Base job:* +1 to your AC and all saves per Bulwark · Defend · Protect (reaction, halves damage).\n**HP** 70 + (6 × your level) · **AC** 24 · **Speed** 30 ft\n**Special.** May use Protect twice per round instead of once."
     }
