    "name": "Final Step",
    "intro": "> *\"Everywhere is reachable in the space between heartbeats.\"*\n\n![](img/realityShift_FinalStep.png)\n\n**Description.** Reality fractures into pure motion. The ground becomes a sea of crystalline frequency rippling in concentric waves; the air hums with visible soundwaves streaking past like ribbons of compressed thunder; every surface — stone, metal, flesh — is caught in an eternal oscillation between states of being. At the center hovers **The Tuning Nexus**, a sphere of condensed sonic energy pulsing in time with Khaled's heartbeat, and around it orbit seven **Resonance Rings**, each spinning at its own velocity, each humming a note of a chord that should not exist. Time hasn't stopped — it has been outpaced. To anyone outside, those within move in stuttering bursts, appearing in several places at once as motion becomes probability. This is not a battlefield. It is the frequency at which existence hums when all friction dies.",
