   "Sonic Wave": "While Peco and Makoa are Paired in Combat and within 30 ft of each other, they may use a **Pair Action** and each consume 1 Grimm Slot to unleash **Sonic Wave** — a devastating, terrain-breaking roar infused with high-frequency molecular resonance.\n\nThrough a brief hand contact, Peco accelerates the **molecular vibration of Makoa’s breath** to catastrophic levels, and Makoa releases it in a single, devastating cone of sound and force that turns stone to dust and armor to splinters.\n\n---\n\n### ✦ **Vibrational Shockburst**\n\nMakoa exhales a **60 ft cone** of **sonic destruction**. All creatures and structures in the cone must make a **Constitution Saving Throw** against the **Pair DC**.\n\n#### On a **Failure**, a creature:\n- Takes **force + thunder damage** based on the Grimm Users' level:\n\n\t- **1–4:** `6d10 thunder + 6d10 force`\n\t    \n\t- **5–9:** `10d10 thunder + 10d10 force`\n\t    \n\t- **10–14:** `14d10 thunder + 14d10 force`\n\t    \n\t- **15–19:** `18d10 thunder + 18d10 force`\n\t    \n\t- **20:** `22d10 thunder + 22d10 force`\n    \n- Is **knocked prone** and **deafened** for 1 minute.\n    \n- Suffers **armor disruption**: until the end of their next turn, they **lose resistance** to all damage types and have **–5 to AC**.\n    \n\n#### On a **Success**:\n\n- Takes **half damage** and is not knocked prone, but is still **deafened** until the end of their next turn.\n    \n\n---\n\n### ✦ **Structure and Terrain**\n\n- **Unattended objects**, **structures**, **terrain**, and **magical barriers** (e.g., _Wall of Force_, _Sanctuary_) within the cone automatically take **max damage** and must succeed on a **DC 20 Constitution Check** or shatter, collapse, or be destroyed.\n    \n- **Walls**, **statues**, and **cover** are pulverized into debris. Creatures behind destroyed terrain lose any benefit from it immediately and must also make a **Dexterity Saving Throw** or take **2d10 bludgeoning damage** from falling rubble.\n    \n\n---\n\n### ✦ **Scaling Features**\n\n- **Level 5+**: Targets who fail the save also suffer **disadvantage on Strength and Dexterity saves** until the end of their next turn.\n    \n- **Level 10+**: The cone expands to **80 ft**, and magical armor is suppressed for 1 round (loses enchantment bonuses).\n    \n- **Level 15+**: All damage **bypasses resistances**. Creatures using magical flight must make a **Constitution Save** or fall.\n    \n- **Level 20**: Creatures who fail the save are also **Shattered**: they cannot take Reactions, Bonus Actions, or maintain Concentration until the end of their next turn.\n    \n\n---",
